DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260511T160000
UID:69ac94652866a5b4884091c1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon film to celebrate Asian Heritage Mont
 h. Tea & coffee will be served.\nMinari (2020)\nA Korean American family m
 oves to an Arkansas farm in search of its own American dream. Amidst the c
 hallenges of new life in the strange and rugged Ozarks\, they discover the
  undeniable resilience of family and what really makes a home.\nNo registr
 ation required.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
