DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T193000
UID:69c402148d5e2d093367860a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how Google Docs can be a useful free tool when you don't
  have access to Microsoft Word. In this follow-up class to Part 1\, use mo
 re formatting tools such as bullets\, numbered lists\, text alignment\, ma
 rgins\, page numbers\, and Help. You will also learn how to copy and paste
  text and images from the internet and explore templates for resumes and l
 etters.\nPrerequisites: Basic mouse and keyboard skills are required.\nFor
 mat: Hands-on with demonstrations
